          "executionSuccessful": false,
          "toolExecutionNotifications": [
            {
              "level": "error",
              "message": {
                "text": "cargo mutants --in-diff was not attempted (attempted=0). The hard rules for this review forbid cargo test, nextest and cargo-mutants on this host (lambda) and --in-place anywhere. 21 .rs files are in the diff and --match-mutation-trigger fires on all of them, so the mutation consultation is triggered and unreachable; the PR own CI mutants job is the only measurement."
              }
